s a documentation enabler while EPIC-07 is an infrastructure enabler, so a reviewer may prefer separate themes | Review theme grouping with the product owner during backlog review | Current grouping used; both epics keep their own traceability and sequencing regardless of theme membership |\n\n### summary\n- total_themes: 4\n- total_epics: 8\n- total_enablers: 2\n- total_spikes: 0\n- total_reclassified: 10\n- unaligned_epics: 0\n- uncovered_goals: 0\n- uncovered_personas: 0\n- pending_inputs: 0\n- assumptions: 1\n- status: complete\n\n---","replace_all":false}}}
